@headitem Resource @tab Ceiling @tab Estimate @tab Initial margin
@item Added latency, p99 (ESC-SRS-079) @tab 1 ms @tab 0.1 ms @tab 90% (green)
@item Peak RSS (ESC-SRS-080) @tab 8 MiB @tab 3 MiB @tab 62% (green)
@item Stripped binary (ESC-SRS-103) @tab 6 MiB @tab 3 MiB @tab 50% (green)
